Field Review - Addition / Alteration - 4008 W 18th

Exterior and interior alterations and change of use from one family dwelling to one family dwelling with secondary suite to this existing building on site.

Scope of work includes:
New secondary suite in the basement;
New 59 sqft covered porch on existing rear deck on the main floor;
New kitchen on the main floor;
New exterior sliding door on the main floor;
Removal of chimney on the east elevation;
New fire fighter pathway on site.

OK for field review per O. Luo, Mar 3rd, 2026

Schedule B Structural: Jacob Plut - Allester Engineering 
604-228-0518

Addressing:
#1-4008 W 18th Av – Single Detached House (2nd - 3rd floor, north portion of 1st floor) 
#2-4008 W 18th Av - Secondary Suite (south portion of 1st floor)
